Author: loop-bench <loop-bench@localhost>
Date:   Fri Nov 6 17:16:34 2026 +0100

    feat(transport): validate list_sessions frames

    Adds the incoming ListSessionsMessage to the protocol union (additive) and
    a list_sessions case in the frame validator: optional non-negative integer
    limit, optional before cursor whose sessionId is 1-128 chars and whose
    updatedAt parses as a timestamp, unknown fields like userId stripped and
    errors naming the field. Cites the unit test on the conversation-list spec
    statement and repoints that spec's stale acceptance-test anchors.

    Refs re-cinq/HALEngine#144

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

